   "t": "p",
   "html": "A Great Day On the beach 2 Gold bits, 1 Signet ring and an earing with pearls, a live round and some pre decimal coins, I covered alot of beach as you can see from the gps track on the screen of the CTX, which is a really helpful bonus when gridding out the beach."
