   "t": "p",
   "html": "A Crack appeared on the back of the \"<a href=\"@sand-scoops-for-metal-detecting/\" data-kind=\"internal\">Evolution sand scoop</a>\" so that will need mending, i was told it will be the <a href=\"http://bit.ly/2G1BivI\" data-kind=\"affiliate\">strongest sand scoop</a> i will ever use...<a href=\"https://youtu.be/Uu6BJnmGrO8\" data-kind=\"external\">Which sandscoops and shafts</a> do i prefer"
